#: playfield.cpp:250
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your opponent is using a pre-KDE4 version of Naval Battle. Note that, "
"according to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed "
"adjacent to one another and only one ship of each size is allowed."
msgstr "Protivnik koristi inačicu igre Naval Battle stariju od KDE-a 4. Imajte na umu da prema pravilima starih klijenata brodovi ne mogu biti jedan do drugoga i dopušten je samo jedan brod svake veličine."

